he kit targets T0 specified does not exist\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1232:## 11. Decisions, amendments, and owner questions\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1277:  emitter, and is permitted (contradiction C1).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1282:1. Ratify C1/A3: may a register kernel translate the register image it\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1285:2. Ratify C2: the LLVM worker's streams are node-local and artifacts\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1300:client and transports; WASM as an artifact target — superseded by [yang.wasm.md](./yang.wasm.md) (register-image-to-wasm lowering), [yin.vm.engine.md](./yin.vm.engine.md) (§E.1–§E.5, guest-agnostic execution host, `yin.vm.engine.host.v1` ABI, and K0/W0 conformance method), and [yin.vm.debruijn.register.md](./yin.vm.debruijn.register.md) (§10, register wasm execution instance and K0/W0 register fixtures) (owner-authorized wasm plan, 2026-10-18 / 2026-10-19).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1304:## 12. Risks\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1325:   linking, sealing and collection. Level 2 is the expensive phase and\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1326:   is last for that reason; Level 1 gives effectful programs without it.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.rust-kernel.md:1335:Related specs: [yin.vm.engine.md](./yin.vm.engine.md) (§E.1–§E.5, in-instance engine, wasm implementation of dao.stream, and K0/W0 conformance method); [yang.wasm.md](./yang.wasm.md) (register-image-to-wasm lowering); [yin.vm.debruijn.register.md](./yin.vm.debruijn.register.md) (§10, register wasm execution instance, K0/W0 register fixture schema, and register W0–W6 / Rust K1–K5 lane gates).\ndocs/design/dao.agent.md:179:or WebSocket (`dao.stream.ws`). The MCP server exposes bounded tools to LLMs:\ndocs/design/dao.agent.mcp.server.md:76:            dao.stream.ws, dao.jing, yin.vm.linker,\ndocs/design/dao.agent.mcp.server.md:127:### 3.3 WebSocket transport (`dao.stream.ws`)\ndocs/design/dao.agent.mcp.server.md:129:The WebSocket tra